# Rocketship Svelte

Build or port with `.agents/skills/rocketship-component-svelte/SKILL.md`. Every other `.agents/rules` file applies to Svelte too.

- Astro (`packages/base`) is the source of truth. When Astro and Svelte differ, Astro wins.
- Svelte components live in `packages/svelte/src/components`; their Storybook is `apps/svelte`.
- Svelte 5 with runes and TypeScript. One component per `.svelte` file, in this order: `<script lang="ts">`, markup, `<style lang="scss">`.
- `as?` only when the Astro original has it. Never a single-value union.
- Spread attributes before the class: `<svelte:element this={as} {...attrs} class={classes}>`.
- Wrap all rules in `:global { … }` inside `<style lang="scss">`. A `global` attribute on `<style>` does nothing. `:global(.rs-name) { &__title {} }` and `:global(&)` do not compile.
- `@use '@labcat2020/rocketship/styles/mixins' as *;` once per style block. Never copy token source into `packages/svelte`.
- Container queries only where the Astro original uses them.
- Never bump `version` in a component PR. Merging to `main` publishes any bumped package.
